term": "分次环"}, {"source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"source_term": "open subschemes", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "齐次谱"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "multiplication", "target_term": "乘法"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"source_term": "identity map", "target_term": "恒等映射"}, {"source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"source_term": "open neighbourhood", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为概形（scheme）。\n设<MATH_0002>为可逆（invertible）<MATH_0003>-模（module）。\n置<MATH_0004>，并将其视为分次环（graded ring）。\n若<MATH_0005>的每个点（point）都属于某个开子概形（open subschemes）<MATH_0006>，其中<MATH_0007>是某个齐次（homogeneous）元素，则存在如下典范态射（canonical morphism）（在概形（schemes）之间）\n<MATH_0008>，\n其目标为<MATH_0009>的齐次谱（homogeneous spectrum）（见《Constructions》第<REF_0001>节）。\n此态射（morphism）具有下列性质：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0010>对任意齐次（homogeneous）的<MATH_0011>成立；\n<STRUCT_0003> 存在<MATH_0012>-模（module）映射（maps）\n<MATH_0013>，\n它们与乘法（multiplication）映射（maps）相容，见《Constructions》中的等式（<REF_0002>）；\n<STRUCT_0004> 复合（composition）\n<MATH_0014>\n是恒等映射（identity map）；\n<STRUCT_0005> 对每个<MATH_0015>，存在一个整数（integer）<MATH_0016>和一个开邻域（open neighbourhood）<MATH_0017>，该邻域包含<MATH_0018>，使得<MATH_0019>\n对所有<MATH_0020>都是同构（isomorphism）。\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:a76d5dcdcc891ed42ae25122a00c5a0437eb806ad8461ae909764dd41cbe815b", "unit_id": "tag:01PZ:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "引理开头给定的几何对象。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "用于修饰给定的模。", "source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"context": "分别用于给定的可逆模和后文的模映射。", "source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"context": "赋予所定义的环以分次结构。", "source_term": "graded ring", "target_term": "分次环"}, {"context": "覆盖条件所量化的概形的点。", "source_term": "point", "target_term": "点"}, {"context": "覆盖条件中的开子概形。", "source_term": "open subschemes", "target_term": "开子概形"}, {"context": "修饰覆盖条件和第一项性质中的元素。", "source_term": "homogeneous", "target_term": "齐次"}, {"context": "结论所断言存在的态射。", "source_term": "canonical morphism", "target_term": "典范态射"}, {"context": "说明所得态射是概形之间的态射。", "source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "分次环的齐次谱，是所得态射的目标。", "source_term": "homogeneous spectrum", "target_term": "齐次谱"}, {"context": "引出所得态射的各项性质。", "source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"context": "分别指模映射和由乘法给出的映射。", "source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "说明相容性涉及由乘法给出的映射。", "source_term": "multiplication", "target_term": "乘法"}, {"context": "第三项性质中的映射复合。", "source_term": "composition", "target_term": "复合"}, {"context": "第三项性质给出的复合结果。", "source_term": "identity map", "target_term": "恒等映射"}, {"context": "最后一项性质中的存在量词所限定的数。", "source_term": "integer", "target_term": "整数"}, {"context": "最后一项性质中给定点的开邻域。", "source_term": "open neighbourhood", "target_term": "开邻域"}, {"context": "最后一项性质所断言的映射性质。", "source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}]}
